{
  "name": "Send a WhatsApp template with ContactShip when a Google Sheets row is added",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send a WhatsApp template to new rows\n\nWhen a row is added to your Google Sheet, the contact is created (or updated) in ContactShip and receives an approved WhatsApp template.\n\n**Setup**\n1. Your sheet needs the columns **Name**, **Phone** (international format, e.g. +5215512345678) and **Country**.\n2. In **New Row**, connect Google Sheets and pick the document and sheet.\n3. In **Send Template**, pick the WhatsApp **Channel** and an approved **Template**. Map its placeholders in **Body Variables**, in order.\n4. Activate the workflow.\n\nTemplates are required to start a WhatsApp conversation; free text only works within 24 hours of the contact's last message.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "616f3b87-8ad9-57d2-b672-eb18e1e7f00b",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "event": "rowAdded",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "93637a98-05fc-5cb9-bb92-172786b40b5f",
      "name": "New Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheetsTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "contact",
        "operation": "upsert",
        "phoneNumber": "={{ $json.Phone }}",
        "fullName": "={{ $json.Name }}",
        "country": "={{ $json.Country }}",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "dcefebd4-7a39-5815-ac43-3e22184aa332",
      "name": "Create or Update Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-contactship.contactShip",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        260,
        200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "whatsapp",
        "operation": "sendTemplate",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "",
          "mode": "list"
        },
        "contactId": "={{ $json.id }}",
        "templateName": "",
        "bodyVariables": {
          "variable": [
            {
              "value": "={{ $('New Row').item.json.Name }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3aae7677-2c97-56ca-baf9-a6ad4a6a97cf",
      "name": "Send Template",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-contactship.contactShip",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        520,
        200
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "New Row": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Create or Update Contact",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Create or Update Contact": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Send Template",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
